WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:04.100
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream")

01:04.100 --> 01:05.460
(Author: Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 2=

01:10.350 --> 01:11.080
You shouldn't look

01:11.080 --> 01:12.700
at what you shouldn't
be looking at, Young Lady.

01:12.920 --> 01:13.720
Stand still.

01:13.840 --> 01:14.520
Don't move.

01:20.160 --> 01:22.120
The person coming should be
a Lady of Gentleness.

01:23.040 --> 01:24.800
How do you know
it's a Lady of Gentleness?

01:26.680 --> 01:27.720
By the sound.

01:28.240 --> 01:29.880
The jade worn by a Lady of Gentleness

01:30.320 --> 01:31.560
comes from Dongjiang.

01:31.800 --> 01:33.160
The sound is slightly dull,

01:33.320 --> 01:34.440
unlike top-quality jade.

01:36.080 --> 01:37.440
You are a Lady of Gentleness too?

01:39.510 --> 01:40.200
Senior Attendant.

01:43.520 --> 01:45.280
A mere Senior Attendant

01:46.040 --> 01:49.320
actually dares to dream of
competing for the Emperor's bed.

01:50.720 --> 01:51.920
Success depends on effort.

01:52.480 --> 01:54.920
Perhaps His Majesty likes my type.

01:57.380 --> 01:59.980
It's thanks to Father's plea
that I was titled Lady of Gentleness.

02:00.280 --> 02:02.760
I must seize the time to get a chance
to attend to him tonight.

02:06.440 --> 02:08.600
Applying the juice
of this flower to your skin

02:08.800 --> 02:10.760
can make it as supple as jade.

02:10.920 --> 02:12.160
Its fragrance is exquisite,

02:12.280 --> 02:13.000
and

02:13.160 --> 02:14.760
it has aphrodisiac effects.

02:15.080 --> 02:16.000
It can make a man

02:16.120 --> 02:17.280
unable to stop,

02:17.560 --> 02:19.040
lost in ecstasy.

02:19.360 --> 02:20.560
Is it that effective?

02:21.160 --> 02:22.240
Absolutely.

02:22.610 --> 02:23.560
Then, pick more of them.

02:25.120 --> 02:25.840
Attendant Li,

02:26.160 --> 02:27.080
do you know

02:27.240 --> 02:28.200
what flower this is?

02:28.720 --> 02:29.840
Shady tricks.

02:30.760 --> 02:31.800
Of course, I wouldn't know.

02:32.680 --> 02:33.720
Women who enter the palace

02:33.920 --> 02:35.480
must fight for favor.

02:35.640 --> 02:37.040
So what if it's a shady trick?

02:37.340 --> 02:38.320
After all, in the palace,

02:38.330 --> 02:40.350
there's only one man available,
who is the Emperor.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.520
Vulgar.

02:43.360 --> 02:45.040
You're a seller of the art of seduction,

02:45.040 --> 02:46.600
yet you think I'm vulgar?

02:47.200 --> 02:48.240
Besides, it's you men

02:48.240 --> 02:49.600
who liked vulgarity first.

02:52.680 --> 02:53.200
Who?

02:53.280 --> 02:54.120
Who's there?

03:06.920 --> 03:08.360
Do you know who I am?

03:08.720 --> 03:11.080
I am Senior Attendant Rou,
personally titled by the Emperor.

03:11.760 --> 03:12.800
If you dare to scare me,

03:12.810 --> 03:14.400
I'll have His Majesty cut off your head!

03:18.600 --> 03:19.720
We're stopping the search.

03:20.000 --> 03:20.480
Go back.

03:22.900 --> 03:23.550
Hurry, let's go.

03:28.480 --> 03:29.680
It seems Lady Xu

03:29.680 --> 03:31.040
is not as stupid as outsiders say.

03:31.600 --> 03:33.120
She's quite good at framing others.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.400
Let's go.

03:38.040 --> 03:39.200
I'll see you out.

03:54.080 --> 03:55.360
Keep walking straight,

03:55.400 --> 03:57.580
and you will reach
the small gate out of the courtyard.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.560
After you go out,

03:59.600 --> 04:00.800
then take off the blindfold.

04:01.120 --> 04:02.160
But I can't see.

04:02.280 --> 04:03.560
How can I walk?

04:03.960 --> 04:05.240
There are no obstacles ahead.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.200
So, walk with confidence.

04:25.760 --> 04:27.080
(I want to see)

04:27.360 --> 04:29.640
(if you are truly foolish
or just pretending.)

04:30.720 --> 04:32.240
(This is the scent of lake water.)

04:33.080 --> 04:34.520
(Is he trying to silence me?)

04:34.720 --> 04:35.760
(Or is he)

04:36.360 --> 04:37.200
(testing me?)

04:43.800 --> 04:45.120
At the hour of Zi tomorrow night,

04:45.200 --> 04:46.480
see you at the Yuehui Pavilion.

04:47.080 --> 04:48.240
I won't wait if you're late.

05:05.300 --> 05:07.390
She caught Your Majesty
entering the garden at night.

05:07.400 --> 05:08.520
There will be trouble.

05:09.760 --> 05:11.040
It seems we can only kill her.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.400
She doesn't recognize me.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.880
This woman is strange.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.520
I want to see

05:18.640 --> 05:21.560
how she learns
the art of seduction from me.

05:22.180 --> 05:22.880
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:25.320 --> 05:26.000
Madam.

05:27.000 --> 05:27.680
Madam.

05:27.840 --> 05:28.360
Well?

05:28.400 --> 05:30.380
Did you see clearly
who was hiding in the shadows?

05:30.420 --> 05:31.520
It was Senior Attendant Rou.

05:31.920 --> 05:32.960
How could it be her?

05:33.280 --> 05:34.680
And I used her name.

05:35.920 --> 05:37.080
What a wench.

05:37.520 --> 05:39.120
She must have been hiding to set me up.

05:40.800 --> 05:43.240
Then, we'll strike first
to gain the upper hand.

05:48.800 --> 05:49.640
Have you heard?

05:49.650 --> 05:51.520
Someone broke into
the Cold Palace last night.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.840
If it were the Empress

05:53.840 --> 05:55.460
in charge of the harem,
it would be fine.

05:55.640 --> 05:56.600
But now,

05:56.800 --> 05:57.760
it happens to be

05:57.760 --> 05:59.960
the eccentric Lady Liu
of Bright Deportment.

06:00.190 --> 06:01.840
Someone accidentally disturbed her rest,

06:01.850 --> 06:03.120
and they almost lost their life.

06:03.160 --> 06:05.360
Lady Liu of Gentleness, I misspoke.

06:05.680 --> 06:06.680
It is fine.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.360
But the one who
broke into the Cold Palace

06:09.760 --> 06:11.520
is likely in big trouble today.

06:12.760 --> 06:14.080
I know, right?

06:14.560 --> 06:15.560
Today,

06:15.800 --> 06:16.960
the person

06:17.160 --> 06:19.400
will not escape death.

06:28.160 --> 06:30.080
Greetings, Ladies.

06:34.080 --> 06:36.720
(Broadly Learned and Determined)
Lady of Bright Deportment has arrived!

06:45.080 --> 06:47.720
- Greetings, Your Ladyship.
- Greetings, Your Ladyship.

06:56.080 --> 06:57.120
Be seated.

06:57.290 --> 06:59.560
- Thank you, Your Ladyship.
- Thank you, Your Ladyship.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.120
Her Ladyship asks

07:02.640 --> 07:04.600
who went to the Cold Palace last night.

07:04.780 --> 07:06.480
Entering the Cold Palace
without permission

07:06.490 --> 07:07.880
is forbidden by His Majesty's rules.

07:08.640 --> 07:10.320
Whoever dares to violate
the palace rules

07:10.760 --> 07:12.200
is seeking death.

07:18.560 --> 07:19.800
Will no one admit it?

07:28.240 --> 07:29.080
Senior Attendant Rou,

07:29.200 --> 07:30.240
you have a lot of nerve!

07:38.560 --> 07:40.960
Your Majesty, someone sent
a secret report to Lady Liu

07:40.970 --> 07:42.470
stating Shen Zhinian
broke into the Cold Palace.

07:42.480 --> 07:44.700
She is being interrogated
at Yurong Palace right now.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.280
If she confesses to seeing Attendant Li,

07:46.380 --> 07:47.920
it will inevitably involve Your Majesty

07:48.110 --> 07:49.920
and cause suspicion
regarding the Cold Palace.

07:50.400 --> 07:51.840
If she dares to mention me,

07:52.960 --> 07:53.640
then

07:54.720 --> 07:55.680
kill her.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.120
This morning,

07:58.120 --> 07:59.920
I heard from several maids on watch

08:00.000 --> 08:02.320
that last night, someone
claiming to be Senior Attendant Rou

08:02.320 --> 08:03.390
broke into the Cold Palace.

08:03.880 --> 08:06.040
I was passing the Cold Palace
on my watch last night,

08:06.040 --> 08:09.120
and I indeed heard a woman
claiming to be Senior Attendant Rou.

08:09.400 --> 08:10.640
I heard it as well.

08:11.360 --> 08:12.520
Shen Zhinian,

08:13.040 --> 08:14.240
do you admit your guilt?

08:14.480 --> 08:16.480
I did not go to
the Cold Palace last night.

08:17.040 --> 08:18.560
I went to Lady Xu's palace.

08:19.320 --> 08:20.240
You're slandering me.

08:20.250 --> 08:21.800
How could you have come to my palace?

08:22.320 --> 08:23.360
In the main hall,

08:23.840 --> 08:25.280
because of my promotion

08:25.280 --> 08:26.880
to Senior Attendant Rou,

08:27.100 --> 08:28.190
Lady Xu was very displeased.

08:28.560 --> 08:30.200
I felt anxious at night

08:30.200 --> 08:31.240
and could not sleep.

08:32.160 --> 08:33.800
So, I made some pastries myself

08:33.880 --> 08:35.240
and went to Lady Xu's to apologize.

08:35.250 --> 08:36.490
Your Ladyship, please look into this.

08:36.500 --> 08:37.480
I saw with my own eyes...

08:41.400 --> 08:42.920
I saw with my own eyes

08:43.120 --> 08:44.480
the maids on watch say

08:44.640 --> 08:45.720
it was Senior Attendant Rou

08:45.720 --> 08:46.940
who broke into the Cold Palace.

08:48.000 --> 08:49.240
Every bird leaves a trace.

08:49.600 --> 08:50.680
If you went there,

08:51.200 --> 08:52.800
I would find out.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.600
Whoever is lying,

08:55.080 --> 08:57.760
I will have her tongue ripped out.

08:59.320 --> 09:00.080
Your Majesty,

09:00.320 --> 09:02.600
Lady Liu wants to rip out
Senior Attendant Rou's tongue.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.520
Oh?

09:06.720 --> 09:07.840
In Lady Xu's palace,

09:07.840 --> 09:09.440
there are several tuberose plants.

09:10.080 --> 09:12.120
I am allergic to tuberose.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.600
But to seek her forgiveness,

09:14.600 --> 09:16.320
I had to wait at her palace gate.

09:16.600 --> 09:18.160
The passing servants all saw me.

09:21.600 --> 09:22.640
Tonight, Xu Baoqin

09:22.640 --> 09:24.240
used my name at the Cold Palace.

09:24.520 --> 09:26.720
I'm afraid there will
be trouble tomorrow.

09:32.600 --> 09:33.920
Put on my cloak.

09:34.040 --> 09:34.900
Go and return quickly.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.680
Your Ladyship, please look.

09:49.100 --> 09:50.800
She really did have
an allergic reaction.

09:50.840 --> 09:51.400
Perhaps

09:51.520 --> 09:53.040
you caught this somewhere else,

09:53.160 --> 09:54.960
or you're allergic to something else?

09:55.240 --> 09:55.960
Tuberose

09:56.240 --> 09:58.360
was brought from home by Lady Xu.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.880
In the entire palace,

09:59.890 --> 10:01.720
they are only found
at Lady Xu's palace gate.

10:02.400 --> 10:03.980
If you do not believe me, Your Ladyship,

10:04.120 --> 10:05.840
you can bring any other flower.

10:06.400 --> 10:08.480
I can find out with one simple test.

10:09.640 --> 10:10.320
I...

10:10.640 --> 10:11.120
I...

10:11.240 --> 10:14.640
You were upset because His Majesty
named me Senior Attendant Rou,

10:14.640 --> 10:15.890
so you harassed me on the spot.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.560
At night, you went to the garden

10:17.560 --> 10:20.120
and shouted the title
"Senior Attendant Rou" on purpose.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.960
You did it all just to frame me.

10:22.120 --> 10:22.440
No.

10:22.440 --> 10:22.760
I didn't...

10:22.760 --> 10:24.580
Your waist pendant
was dropped in the Cold Palace.

10:25.690 --> 10:26.400
That's impossible.

10:26.520 --> 10:28.680
I clearly double-checked
when I returned last night.

10:28.680 --> 10:29.890
I didn't leave anything behind.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.120
She really went there.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.440
That's a serious crime.

10:35.960 --> 10:36.880
How could she dare?

10:36.880 --> 10:37.720
Your Ladyship.

10:37.730 --> 10:38.290
Your Ladyship.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.800
Your Ladyship, please let me explain.

10:39.960 --> 10:40.560
Your Ladyship.

10:40.570 --> 10:41.990
Your Ladyship, listen to my explanation.

10:42.040 --> 10:42.640
Your Ladyship.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.280
Your Ladyship.

10:43.480 --> 10:44.320
Your Ladyship!

10:58.720 --> 10:59.640
Xu Baoqin,

10:59.760 --> 11:00.760
ten strokes of the cane

11:00.760 --> 11:02.790
and one month of confinement
to serve as a warning to others.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.120
So she is being punished.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.320
As she should be.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.240
Indeed.

11:10.560 --> 11:13.000
An oral decree from the Dowager Consort.

11:20.960 --> 11:23.240
For violating palace rules,

11:23.480 --> 11:24.720
Lady Xu is stripped of her rank,

11:24.880 --> 11:26.000
sentenced to tongue-removal,

11:26.200 --> 11:27.920
and confined to the Cold Palace.

11:29.640 --> 11:30.760
Can she even survive that?

11:31.360 --> 11:32.200
Attendant Wu,

11:32.440 --> 11:33.640
what is the meaning of this?

11:35.720 --> 11:36.960
Bring her in.

11:40.680 --> 11:41.480
Kneel.

11:45.090 --> 11:46.160
Your Ladyship, have mercy.

11:46.180 --> 11:47.320
Your Ladyship, have mercy.

11:47.960 --> 11:48.800
Who is this?

11:49.320 --> 11:51.720
This is Jing, Lady Xu's maid.

11:52.120 --> 11:53.080
She confessed

11:53.240 --> 11:56.320
that Lady Xu broke into
the Cold Palace last night

11:56.320 --> 11:58.560
to pick forbidden flowers.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.120
Drag her away.

12:03.840 --> 12:04.760
Your Ladyship...

12:04.760 --> 12:05.920
Help me, Your Ladyship.

12:06.200 --> 12:08.240
Your Ladyship, help me.

12:08.320 --> 12:09.560
Save me.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.240
This is so pitiable.

12:11.240 --> 12:12.400
Your Ladyship!

12:16.840 --> 12:18.600
All of you,
go out and watch her punishment.

12:19.200 --> 12:20.160
Remember

12:20.600 --> 12:21.560
to behave yourselves.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.080
(Within these towering palace walls,)

12:25.400 --> 12:27.200
(one wrong step leads to eternal ruin.)

12:27.720 --> 12:29.040
(If I want to survive,)

12:29.280 --> 12:31.680
(I must secure the Emperor's
favor as soon as possible.)

12:41.500 --> 12:46.620
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

12:48.340 --> 12:53.580
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

12:55.220 --> 12:57.580
♪If we don't meet♪

12:57.780 --> 13:01.020
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:01.220 --> 13:07.740
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:08.100 --> 13:14.540
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:14.900 --> 13:21.220
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:21.740 --> 13:28.420
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:28.420 --> 13:35.300
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

13:35.540 --> 13:41.420
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

13:42.340 --> 13:48.940
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

13:49.100 --> 13:55.780
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

13:56.060 --> 14:02.500
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
